{"id":1160603,"name":"레타·심문 III","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"레타·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1160603]}],"trial":{"trial_id":160603,"stage":"3단계","unlock_time":"2023-08-15 14:00:00","diary1":"적막하고 기괴한 '고성' 앞, 레타는 램프를 꽉 움켜쥐며 리얼하고 스릴 넘치는 탐험을 기대했다.","diary2":"탐험은 늘 예상치 못한 상황이나 놀라움이 따르기 마련이다. 좁은 통로가 불바다로 변한다든가, 새로 사귄 친구와 서로 악담을 퍼붓게 된다든가 하는… 당신은 매번 예측할 수 없는 미래를 마주하게 된다.\n　　하지만 이런 문제들도 자립을 원하는 레타의 마음을 꺾지는 못했다. 당신은 레타에게 직접 선택할 자유를 주었고 그녀는 계속 자신의 <성장 계획>을 실행하기로 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260401,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260402,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":3,"dialogue_id":260603019,"next":[20]},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":260603023,"next